Package: OHLpkg
Type: Package
Title: Ontario Hockey League Statistics Tools
Version: 2.7.0
Date: 2026-11-02
Authors@R:
    person(
        given = "Noah",
        family = "Cornish",
        role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
        email = "noahcornish7@gmail.com"
    )
Description: Provides functions for accessing, cleaning, filtering, and
    analyzing Ontario Hockey League statistics. Includes tools for retrieving
    skater statistics, goalie statistics, team information, schedules,
    play-by-play events, draft-eligible players, rookies, special-teams
    production, and penalty-minute statistics across supported OHL seasons.
